        "id": 55668,
        "name": "Cosmonaut Zero",
        "username": "Cosmonaut_Zero",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/cosmonaut_zero/{size}/2520_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-19T19:48:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I kinda feel like it has to be something that's sometimes better and sometimes worse. That's one reason I like the redirect idea, with really beefy characters around the redirect would actually be a drawback, but if he has certain cards out it could be really good.</p>",
