        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/z/3be4f8/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-19T20:33:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, I haven't heard any confirmation. It would be cool if they just sold alternate villian/character cards. They might have promos like other games do where you get them if you order from their website early or something. If they do continue promos, I hope they don't do them only for people that buy at conventions though. I dislike con-only promos, especially since I have very little money (only enough to actually buy the games) and I can't afford to ever attend any of the conventions they visit (though I'd love to meet the guys in person).</p>",
