      {
        "id": 55676,
        "name": "zerosatanmine",
        "username": "zerosatanmine",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/z/3be4f8/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-19T20:54:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Christopher\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/48/1851_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Christopher:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Here's a bit of GSF info: the GSF Kickstarter will have no SotM promos. Just GSF promos.Enjoy!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That makes perfect sense! It was so obvious.</p>\n<p>Any info on the future of SoTM promos? Your adoring fanbase wants to know.</p>",
        "post_number": 30,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:30:29.005Z",
