      {
        "id": 55678,
        "name": "EvanDan55",
        "username": "EvanDan55",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/{size}/2374_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-19T21:54:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm with Rabit. I can't see a Mr. Fixer promo happening in the future. And I'm totally fine with that.</p><p>And the promo character/villain cards could always just be con-exclusives. That works with me. Wouldn't be good for some international folks or those who can't get to a convention, but then again, if they keep doing the Sentinels Points program at the cons, people who&nbsp;<em>do&nbsp;</em>go to the cons like me might be inclined to spend some Sentinels Points on spare promo cards and send them to folks who want them.</p>",
