        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-19T22:12:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As someone who isn't close to any of the cons the GTG folks attend (and can't afford to travel to one), put me as one in the camp who would be happy to pay for promos a la carte but would be disappointed if they were con only</p>",
