      {
        "id": 55680,
        "name": "Pydro",
        "username": "Pydro",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-19T22:14:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/948054/how-exclusive-does-a-exclusive-need-to-be-before-i</p><p>EDIT: Just wanted to mention that this discussions is also happening on BGG. I am on the side the nothing should be exclusive if it changes gameply (probaly because I am a completionist). I don't mind that GtG said that the promos will be reprinted, but also be slightly different to keep the KS exclusiveness.</p>",
