        "created_at": "2013-03-20T02:36:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mini Expansions seems to be a good way to go.</p><p>They might be a bit more pricey but at least they provide cool game play.</p><p>Who knows we might see a promo Environment that gives constant effects and would be a great way to have a main card to randomize like Heroes and Villans.</p>",
